    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I see math as a language of patterns and logic that helps me understand the world, even though I don't love it. It shows up in my hobbies like board games and cooking, where strategy and precision matter. I'm not great at it, but I respect how it structures thought and problem-solving in ways that align with my analytical side.",
