    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I haven't used AI much for math, but I've dabbled with tools to check answers or explain steps. It helped when I was stuck, but I felt dependent and unsure if I truly understood. Since I'm part-time employed and not in formal education, I don't rely on it heavily, but it's a useful crutch when curious.",
